    "https://rmu.edu/academics/schools/sbus/sports/summit": {
      "title": "Top Header",
      "description": "RMU Sport Management Career Summit | Robert Morris University Skip to main content Top Header - Left Students Faculty / Staff Careers Career Center Top Header - Right Request Info Visit Make a Gift APPLY NOW Search the RMU Website You must have JavaScript enabled to use this form. Search Main navigation Why Choose RMU? WHY CHOOSE RMU? Reputation and Outcomes RMU is Affordable Campus Experience Pittsburgh: Thriving City Personal Attention Flexible Learning Athletic Tradition Admissions ADMISSIONS Freshman Admissions Graduate & Doctoral Admissions Transfer Admissions International Admissions Part-time, Readmission and Guest Students Veterans & Military Families Student Financial Services Financial Aid Office College Affordability Academy Academics ACADEMICS Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Doctoral Programs Certificate Programs Online Programs Schools & Departments Office of the Provost Special Academic Programs Research & Grants Administration Academic Calendar Elaine Boyd Library Alumni & Giving ALUMNI & GIVING Alumni Association Alumni Events Giving Options Update Your Information Athletics ATHLETICS RMUColonials.com UPMC Events Center Island Sports Center Club Sports Historic Highlights Support Colonials About RMU ABOUT RMU Office of the President Professional Development and Education Board of Trustees Center for Cyber Research and Training Mission, Vision, and Values University History Newsroom Events RMU Center for Veterans and Military Families Campus Police Collaborative Learning Institute Bayer Center for Nonprofit Management Academic Media Center Covestro Center for Community Engagement Menu GIVE | VISIT | GET INFO | APPLY RMU Sport Management Career Summit Student Registration Industry Professionals Visiting College Students 50th Anniversary Celebration & Career Summit Career Summit Schedule Anniversary Schedule Travel & Accommodations Sutton-Hardy Scholarship Auction Support The Future Friday, October 16, 2026 The RMU Sport Management Career Summit connects students, alumni, and industry professionals for a day of learning, networking, and career development . Schedule 8:45 AM Welcome and Opening Remarks Welcome from university and program leadership as we begin a day focused on the future of the sport industry. Opening Panel 9:00 AM The Soccer Boom: Opportunities in the World's Fastest Growing Sport Explore how the FIFA World Cup, expanding professional leagues, and continued investment are creating exciting new career opportunities throughout the sports industry. Concurrent Workshops 10:00 AM Choose one of three sessions: Innovation, AI & the Future of Sport Explore how artificial intelligence, analytics, automation, and emerging technologies are transforming the sports industry. The Business of Youth Sports Learn about one of the fastest-growing sectors of the industry and careers in travel sports, governing bodies, facilities, recreation, coaching, and entrepreneurship. Beyond the Logo: Creating Partnerships That Deliver Results Discover how organizations create sponsorship activations that generate measurable business value while enhancing the fan experience. Industry Roundtable Session I 11:00 AM Meet sport industry professionals in a speed-networking format designed to encourage conversation, mentorship, and career advice. Lunch Noon Lunch will include recognition of scholarship recipients and a special retrospective celebrating fifty years of RMU Sport Management. Industry Roundtable Session II 1:00 PM Continue networking with a new group of professionals representing organizations throughout the sports industry. Featured Conversation 2:00 PM Join us for a special conversation with one of the sports industry's most influential business leaders. Featured guest to be announced soon. Networking & Organizational Fair 2:45 PM Meet employers, discover internship opportunities, and connect with organizations from across the sports industry. Reservations Our official hotel will be DoubleTree By Hilton Pittsburgh International Airport, 8402 University Boulevard. Moon Township, Pennsylvania 15108. Below is the reservation link. Guests can also call 412-329-1400 to make a reservation. Please ask for the RMU Sport Management Career Summit using the Group Code (PMG). Book Your Group Rate Nav - Academics ACADEMICS Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Doctoral Programs Certificate Programs Online Programs Schools & Departments Rockwell School of Business Degrees & Majors Department of Accounting & Taxation Department of Finance Department of Management Department of Marketing Sport Management Sport Management Career Summit Faculty News School of Communication and Media School of Data Intelligence and Technology School of Education and Social Sciences School of Engineering and Science School of Health Professions Office of the Provost Special Academic Programs Research & Grants Administration Academic Calendar Elaine Boyd Library Contact | Campus Map Main navigation Why Choose RMU? WHY CHOOSE RMU? Reputation and Outcomes RMU is Affordable Campus Experience Pittsburgh: Thriving City Personal Attention Flexible Learning Athletic Tradition Admissions ADMISSIONS Freshman Admissions Graduate & Doctoral Admissions Transfer Admissions International Admissions Part-time, Readmission and Guest Students Veterans & Military Families Student Financial Services Financial Aid Office College Affordability Academy Academics ACADEMICS Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Doctoral Programs Certificate Programs Online Programs Schools & Departments Office of the Provost Special Academic Programs Research & Grants Administration Academic Calendar Elaine Boyd Library Alumni & Giving Athletics ATHLETICS RMUColonials.com UPMC Events Center Island Sports Center Club Sports Historic Highlights Support Colonials About RMU ABOUT RMU Office of the President Professional Development and Education Board of Trustees Center for Cyber Research and Training Mission, Vision, and Va