      "description": "Dean's List | Robert Morris University Skip to main content Top Header - Left Students Faculty / Staff Careers Career Center Top Header - Right Request Info Visit Make a Gift APPLY NOW Search the RMU Website You must have JavaScript enabled to use this form. Search Main navigation Why Choose RMU? WHY CHOOSE RMU? Reputation and Outcomes RMU is Affordable Campus Experience Pittsburgh: Thriving City Personal Attention Flexible Learning Athletic Tradition Admissions ADMISSIONS Freshman Admissions Graduate & Doctoral Admissions Transfer Admissions International Admissions Part-time, Readmission and Guest Students Veterans & Military Families Student Financial Services Financial Aid Office College Affordability Academy Academics ACADEMICS Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Doctoral Programs Certificate Programs Online Programs Schools & Departments Office of the Provost Special Academic Programs Research & Grants Administration Academic Calendar Elaine Boyd Library Alumni & Giving ALUMNI & GIVING Alumni Association Alumni Events Giving Options Update Your Information Athletics ATHLETICS RMUColonials.com UPMC Events Center Island Sports Center Club Sports Historic Highlights Support Colonials About RMU ABOUT RMU Office of the President Professional Development and Education Board of Trustees Center for Cyber Research and Training Mission, Vision, and Values University History Newsroom Events RMU Center for Veterans and Military Families Campus Police Collaborative Learning Institute Bayer Center for Nonprofit Management Academic Media Center Covestro Center for Community Engagement Menu GIVE | VISIT | GET INFO | APPLY Dean's List Full-time and part-time students (enrolled in at least 6 undergraduate credits) are eligible for the Dean's list each summer, fall, and spring if they receive a 3.5 semester GPA with no grade lower than \"C.\" The Dean's list is typically published in mid-January following the fall semester and mid-May following the spring semester. Spring 2026 Rockwell School Of Business Alexander, Madeline Marie Ali, Connor Allen, Austin Allison, Brendan Thomas Ammer, Karie Elizabeth Anderson, Dylan Patrick Anthony, Jacob Deane Arnold, Calli Marie Arvanitis, Cyril Asvestas, Ava Azard, Jean Anelson Babcock, John Ray Bach, Travis Baker, Chayce Baranowski, Brooke Barnum, Nicholas Aaron Bartosh, Jocelyn Bash, Logan Thomas Bass, Evan James Battista, Jacob M Beard, Makhi Beaumont, Julian Elton Benitez, Lourdes Angeline Jardenil Berberich, Katelyn Bergad, Hunter Bernauer, Hayley Michelle Bernotas, Jonathan Tyler Berner, Johnathan Heinrich Berthoff, Mia Betz, Zachary Aram Biro, Paige Nella Bisiriyu, Aliyat Blackham, George James Blakley, Noah L Bollman, Calan Boneysteele, Joseph Boni, Kaden Bonnell, Morgan Booz, Giavanna Lin Borelli, Sophia Boring, Brittney Boris, Jacob Alan Borsh, Connor Bower, Ava Lanae Bower, Miley Brazell, Brady Nicholas Bredniak, Ian Brenner, Kaleigh Jo Brew, Lyla Lucia Brooks, Mitchell Brough, Meadow Bruce, Cooper Mason Bruno, Olivia Brunsell, Bella Buccigrossi, Anthony Jason Buchanan, Aubrey F Buckeridge, Steven Emanuel Hugh Bujdos, Rainey Burkarth, Andrew Burkhart, Addi Aubree Burkett, Taylor Ashtyn Burns, Greta Maxine Burns, Shawna Lynn Butler, Aurora Teagan Button, Braylon James Callender, Riley Anne Cambra, Aubrey Candiotti, Isabella Marie Capell, James Caro, Joshua Carroll, Nathan Miller Charles, Samarra Denise Chappell, Jeremy L Chiocca, Hannah Chiodo, Cierra Ciak, Davyn Joesph Cipoletti, Christian Clendaniel, Shaeliyah Milani Clouse, Emilie Cohen, Nicole Colinear, Camden Comulada, Vanessa Corr, Ailise Cotton, Riley M Counasse, Laurel Cowart, Jaylen Lee Coyle, Grace Craig, Michael Crivelli, Gavin Luke Cunnard, Shayna Curry, Brian D'Elia, Thalia Davison, Erik Davis, Cristian Michael Davis, Maddison Renee DeDominicis, Ryan Joseph Defibaugh, Mason Avery Delp, Robert Demartino, Anthony DeProspo, Anthony Desjardins, Shayne Kellie Detwiler, Sophie DeVivo, Mia DiBlasi, Evan Jeffre